\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{Naming, formatting, and generator interfaces remain provisional. Agents may propose changes with mechanical migration and regenerated views. A mathematical definition frozen after its gates changes only through a superseding decision; changes authorized in revision 1 are recorded in its crosswalk and original snapshot.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{Conventions can evolve without silently changing theorem meanings.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rejected}
  \p{Treating a provisional convention as permission to alter a frozen theorem signature.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Acceptance}
  \p{Registry/supersession audit at \ref{ms-0000} and \ref{at-fd-0011}.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Status}
  \p{frozen policy; conventions provisional.}
}
